pydough_code:
brad_pitt_movies_per_year = imdb.actors.WHERE(name == "Brad Pitt").casts.copyright.CALCULATE(
    movie_year=YEAR(id)
).PARTITION(name="years", by=movie_year).CALCULATE(
    movie_year=movie_year,
    number_of_movies=COUNT(copyright)
)

